update parasite
[It's a journal. It's covered in scorch marks.]
[It reads the following text\:]
if {journal_3_read} == false:
	'Your quarry is plenty capable of striking back.'
	'Use caution, little one.'
	'Remain the hunter, not the hunted.'
else:
	[style name="Style_Parasite_Red"]
	'You should stop playing with fire, brother.'
	[style name="Style"]
	[As soon as you turn the next page, a spark erupts from the back of the journal.]
	[It crackles, pops, and detonates. Your host's hand is caught within.]
	[style name="Style_Parasite_Purple"]
	parasite: AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA!
	[style name="Style"]
	[It hurts. It hurts so bad.]
set {journal_3_read} = true